00012 \par
00013 {\cf20 // How to easily locate code?}\par
00014 {\cf20 // - Use Tools->Item Picker to debug break in code by clicking any widgets: https://github.com/ocornut/imgui/wiki/Debug-Tools}\par
00015 {\cf20 // - Browse an online version the demo with code linked to hovered widgets: https://pthom.github.io/imgui_manual_online/manual/imgui_manual.html}\par
