00018 {\cf20 //---------------------------------------------------}\par
00019 {\cf20 // PLEASE DO NOT REMOVE THIS FILE FROM YOUR PROJECT!}\par
00020 {\cf20 //---------------------------------------------------}\par
00021 {\cf20 // Message to the person tempted to delete this file when integrating Dear ImGui into their codebase:}\par
00022 {\cf20 // Think again! It is the most useful reference code that you and other coders will want to refer to and call.}\par
00023 {\cf20 // Have the ImGui::ShowDemoWindow() function wired in an always-available debug menu of your game/app!}\par
