03530         {\cf20 // - The difficulty here is to "interpolate" from RangeSrcItem to RangeDstItem in the SetAll/SetRange request.}\par
03531         {\cf20 //   We want this interpolation to match what the user sees: in visible order, skipping closed nodes.}\par
03532         {\cf20 //   This is implemented by our TreeGetNextNodeInVisibleOrder() user-space helper.}\par
03533         {\cf20 // - Important: In a real codebase aiming to implement full-featured selectable tree with custom filtering, you}\par
03534         {\cf20 //   are more likely to build an array mapping sequential indices to visible tree nodes, since your}\par
03535         {\cf20 //   filtering/search + clipping process will benefit from it. Having this will make this interpolation much easier.}\par
03536         {\cf20 // - Consider this a prototype: we are working toward simplifying some of it.}\par
