04905         {\cf20 // BeginPopupContextItem() is a helper to provide common/simple popup behavior of essentially doing:}\par
04906         {\cf20 //     if (id == 0)}\par
04907         {\cf20 //         id = GetItemID(); // Use last item id}\par
