10017     {\cf20 // About the ImGuiWindowFlags_UnsavedDocument / ImGuiTabItemFlags_UnsavedDocument flags.}\par
10018     {\cf20 // They have multiple effects:}\par
10019     {\cf20 // - Display a dot next to the title.}\par
10020     {\cf20 // - Tab is selected when clicking the X close button.}\par
10021     {\cf20 // - Closure is not assumed (will wait for user to stop submitting the tab).}\par
