10023     {\cf20 //   We need to assume closure by default otherwise waiting for "lack of submission" on the next frame would leave an empty}\par
10024     {\cf20 //   hole for one-frame, both in the tab-bar and in tab-contents when closing a tab/window.}\par
10025     {\cf20 //   The rarely used SetTabItemClosed() function is a way to notify of programmatic closure to avoid the one-frame hole.}\par
10026 \par
